| Vector Search | `db.search()` | ✅ Works | ✅ `db.episodes.search()` with filters |
| Insert Data | `db.insert(text, meta)` | ✅ Works | ✅ + `db.insert(table, data)` |
| Export DB | `db.export()` | ✅ Works | ✅ Same |
