**Cause:** Loading too much into memory

**Solution 1: Use Flash consolidation**
```typescript
const attention = new AttentionService(db.db, {
  enableFlash: true,
  flashWindowSize: 128  // Smaller window
});

await attention.flash.consolidateMemories(vectors);
