**Solution 2: Process in batches**
```typescript
const BATCH_SIZE = 1000;
for (let i = 0; i < vectors.length; i += BATCH_SIZE) {
  const batch = vectors.slice(i, i + BATCH_SIZE);
  await processB(batch);
}
