**When to migrate:**
- ✅ Need hierarchical knowledge organization → Hyperbolic
- ✅ Large memory sets need consolidation → Flash
- ✅ Connected knowledge graphs → Graph-RoPE
- ✅ Multi-domain retrieval → MoE

