await attention.graphRoPE.addEdge(id1, id2, 0.5);
await attention.graphRoPE.addEdge(id1, id3, 0.5);
```

### 2. Graph Density

✅ **Good:**
```typescript
// Sparse graph with meaningful connections
attention.enableFeatures({ graphDensity: 0.1 });  // 10% density
