### Core Operations

soningBank**      | Rerank matching patterns by task type              | query text          |
| **NightlyLearner**     | Prioritize experiment candidates                   | `'experiment'`      |
| **LearningSystem**     | Select best RL algorithm (9 options)               | task description    |
